If I were to use 1 uncursed ?oGenocide, I'd take out master liches
in preference to arch-liches.  Arch-liches take more turns to kill, but
(from the vanquished list in my ascension logs) master liches seem to be
more abundant.

This approach also prevents the unlikely but not impossible (I've
experienced it more than once) occurrence of a manageable red L being
generated when you enter a level, then encountering a !oGL and turning
to a much more annoying purple L after you've moved away from the
stairs.

OTOH, master MFs seem to turn up more often than normal MFs, as well as
getting two more tentacle attacks per turn.

